  "keywords": [],
  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup heavy cream",
    "3 cups half-and-half cream",
    "8 egg yolks",
    "1 cup white sugar",
    "0.125 teaspoon salt"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/AMc_sexuXldts5iv7Vw_tkRPWgM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/214978-ice-cream-base-VAT-005-step-01-1ca324dc5aea429893a3d1ffeda418be.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/214978/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat heavy cream and half-and-half in a heavy-bottomed saucepan over medium-low heat until barely simmering, stirring frequently. Reduce heat to low.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/tn7myHabSQB0Cojm6bnBxReE6b8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/214978-ice-cream-base-VAT-006-step-02-02nohandinframe-eecfeb31fa6b4a73845b3fe63d2a2e33.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/214978/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk egg yolks, sugar, and salt together in a large bowl until thoroughly combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mvAPpSEXjf4d8FzA3x3Wc_gJQ6w=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/214978-ice-cream-base-VAT-007-step-03-02nohand-48d93889084043da8e67daadfd41ac1e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/214978/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slowly pour about 1/2 cup of hot cream mixture into egg yolk mixture, whisking constantly. Repeat three times more, whisking thoroughly before adding each additional 1/2 cup of hot cream to egg yolk mixture. Pour egg yolk mixture back into the saucepan with remaining hot cream, and whisk constantly over medium-low heat until the mixture thickens and will coat the back of a spoon, 5 to 8 minutes. Do not let mixture boil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/BkZ2uSONZgn7ZNIfVvBC5PeIbs4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/214978-ice-cream-base-VAT-008-step-04-01showingcoatingbackofspoon-b3ce0a00e3984f1d8fc7ff1461717fb8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/214978/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour ice cream base into a bowl and allow to cool for about 20 minutes; place in refrigerator and chill overnight.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/bIeRxPZtCD8ClAYDRvpufr4Q2c4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/214978-ice-cream-base-VAT-009-step-05-01notcoveredcooling-5e727f45375848bf84eefce2aa108ee3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/214978/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "The next day, pour into an ice cream maker, and freeze according to the manufacturer's directions.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/NeREcSsm7hixm9TLpx1iYhj_K4s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/214978-ice-cream-base-VAT-010-step-06-01ICmachinecoveroff-00d66f69b091419095b6a767bbf47019.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/214978/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove the ice cream, pack into a covered container, and freeze for 2 hours or overnight before serving. Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/YaF3GkQwpnTv7zYpLvMJaESjt7s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/214978-ice-cream-base-VAT-011-step-07-3b52d49c86694fd88655d8fa17c60323.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/214978/step_07.webp"
    }
  ],
